<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro could be used for dandelion field farm in bee swarm simulator, it goes to the 3rd hive, farms about 700k capacity backpack, releases all the honey into the hive, and starts the farm all over again. It better be used with 25 bees.</Description>
